00:46:31.083 --> 00:46:33.250
Resep keanehan instan.

00:46:33.334 --> 00:46:35.167
Dia tak punya harapan sejak awal.

00:46:35.250 --> 00:46:36.330
Atau...

00:46:37.249 --> 00:46:40.000
